Build only the provider-private USB source closure for the pinned native SDK.
No PlatformIO, downloads, firmware build, release-package mutation, or
publication. Unknown imports and unsupported loader mappings fail
qualification after evidence is written. The generated ELF is an experimental
native candidate, not v0.1.19.

